config SUNPLUS_IOP
	tristate "Sunplus SP7021 IOP (8051) support"
	depends on SOC_SP7021 || COMPILE_TEST
	help
	  Driver for the 8051 I/O processor embedded in the Sunplus SP7021
	  SoC.  The IOP manages GPIO state in low-power modes, handles RTC
	  wake-up, and cooperates with the PMC during suspend and power-off.

	  Built-in firmware is loaded into a reserved SRAM region at boot.
	  Replacement firmware can be uploaded at runtime via sysfs.
